---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Projects :: Jesse Wunderlich"
  description="Things Jesse Wunderlich is building — Nova, Sardonyx Software, temperat.io and more."
  ogTitle="What Jesse is building">
  <div class="box reveal">
    <h2>&gt; payload_manifest.txt</h2>
    <p class="lead">A curated wall of what I'm building. The big one is Nova; the rest are
    smaller bets and tools.</p>

    <div class="proj">
      <p class="status-line">status: active &middot; primary mission</p>
      <b>Nova Net Worth</b> — AI-first net worth tracker. The one I'm betting on.
      <br><a href="https://novanetworth.com" rel="noopener">novanetworth.com &raquo;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <p class="status-line">status: active</p>
      <b>Sardonyx Software</b> — my dev shop (DBA Wunderlich Web). Custom sites
      for local businesses.
      <br><a href="https://sardonyx.software" rel="noopener">sardonyx.software &raquo;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <p class="status-line">status: live &middot; low-maintenance</p>
      <b>temperat.io</b> — a dead-simple instrument tuner. No accounts, no fluff.
      <br><a href="https://temperat.io" rel="noopener">temperat.io &raquo;</a>
    </div>

    <div class="proj">
      <p class="status-line">status: archive</p>
      <b>…and a dozen more</b> — I've started more businesses than I can count.
      Some flew, some didn't. That's the game.
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
